ive impact on their sense of self-worth, but may also expose them to unforeseen dangers."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/457068dfc94aacecf6d6.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"situation.203.a","label":{"zh":"批准请求。","en":"Request approved."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false},{"key":"situation.203.b","label":{"zh":"拒绝请求。","en":"Request denied."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/situation_events.txt","line":1851},"sets":["bio_trophies_help"]},{"id":"situation.292","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"风暴之后","en":"After The Storm"},"texts":[{"zh":"状态报告：[Target.GetName]上的辐射水平已经趋于稳定。[Target.GetStarName]已恢复到正常的恒星活动水平。地磁风暴已经结束。\n\n最终报告：这一挑战性的局势给予我们一个完善防辐射技术的机遇，提升了我们无人机在极端条件下生存的能力。感激这一结果。","en":"Status report: radiation levels on [Target.GetName] are now stable. [Target.GetStarName] has returned to normal levels of solar activity. The geomagnetic storm has ended.\n\nFinal report: the challenging situation gave us an opportunity to perfect our radiation-hardening techniques, increasing our drones' capabilities to survive in extreme conditions. We appreciate this outcome."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/602eb656c2e9a341b17b.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"EXCELLENT","label":{"zh":"棒极了。","en":"Excellent."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[{"target":"situation.299","kind":"delay","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"delay","delay":[{"days":"15"}],"source":"events/situation_events.txt:2693","hooks":["after"],"story":"event-situation-200"}],"source":{"file":"events/situation_events.txt","line":2680},"names":{"Target.GetStarName":{"zh":"这颗恒星","en":"the star"}}},{"id":"situation.299","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"过时助手","en":"Outdated Assistants"},"texts":[{"zh":"信息：尽管我们不再需要生物助手的服务，但我们的活体人口已经变得非常适应这一角色。他们似乎很享受承担责任的机会。如何继续？","en":"Information: while the services of our Bio-Assistants are no longer 